<title>UK: F&amp;C Investment 96 nav rise hit by stg.</title>
<headline>F&amp;C Investment 96 nav rise hit by stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Net asset value(nav)   1,779		  vs 1,689</p>
<p> Net asset value(pence) 168.4		  vs 160.7</p>
<p> Shr (consolidated, p)  2.91		   vs 2.41</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 2.28		   vs 2.07</p>
<p> Consolidated net rev   30.6		   vs 25.4</p>
<p>Full company name - Foreign &amp; Colonian Investment Trust Plc.</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said its nav rise in 1996 of 4.8 percent underperformed the FTSE Allshare, which rose by 11.7 percent, due to sterling appreciation against which it was unhedged.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
